+# Notification audio asset
+
+`waiting.s16le` is a generated spoken “Waiting.” cue: signed 16-bit little-endian PCM, mono, 16 kHz, 17,235 samples (about 1.077 seconds). It is embedded in application flash and streamed in 20 ms blocks; it is not copied into a full-size RAM buffer.
